# Week 5 tests: modular Express + Joi + PostgreSQL
# 1) Run database.sql in pgAdmin  2) npm start  3) run from top to bottom

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 1. Database health (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/database

### 2. GET all movies (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies

### 3. GET existing movie (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/1

### 4. GET missing movie (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/999

### 5. Invalid movie id (400, validateMovieId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies/abc

### 6. Valid POST (201 + Location header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  Arrival  ",
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "year": 2016
}

### 7. Missing required POST field (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "year": 1982
}

### 8. Wrong data type (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": "1982"
}

### 9. Unknown property (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner",
  "director": "Ridley Scott",
  "year": 1982,
  "rating": 5
}

### 10. Complete PUT (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "year": 2010
}

### 11. Incomplete PUT (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception"
}

### 12. Valid PATCH with one field (200)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 13. Empty PATCH (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 14. Filter and sort (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?minYear=2000&sortBy=year

### 15. Invalid sortBy (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?sortBy=rating

### 16. DELETE existing movie (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/2

### 17. Repeat DELETE (404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/movies/2

### 18. Unknown route (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/does-not-exist
